CancelRedeemIntegrationConcreteTest
├── when the caller is unauthorized
│   └── it should revert
├── when the receiver has no pending request
│   └── it should revert
├── given the vault is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when the receiver has a pending request
│   ├── it should return all escrowed shares to the receiver
│   ├── it should zero the pending entry
│   └── it should release the reserved amount from totalPendingAssets
├── when the entry is not at parity
│   └── it should emit the shares and the reserved assets distinctly
└── when called twice for the same receiver
    └── it should revert
